# Sources of the study of earlier restarts and the greenfield carrier (hub 3.13). The carrier's own files are 2.1.8 and 2.1.9; a commit is cited as 2.1#<hash>; first-round reports are cited through 2.31.

n: 2.21
name: earlier-restarts-sources
kind: hub
is: The second-round study report on earlier restart attempts and the greenfield carrier, and 18 primary sources its encoded claims cite: the carrier's witness and door, two specs beside the axioms, the bootstrap page and its three ground files, two revisions of the rewritten seed, two receipts of the rewrite, and five dated private notes. All are files; none was read through a summarising fetch.
